Size: 16+4+4+4+4+1+1+4+4+4+4+4+1+4+4+4+4+4+4+4+4+4+4+4+4 + 24*2*5 + 30*2*2 = let me add it up:
16 (iname) + 4 (item) + 4 (bonus) + 4 (exptype) + 4 (shotspace) + 1+1 (ground,suck) = 34
+ frame_rate 4 = 38
